---
title: "withdrawRaisedCapital (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: check caller is projectAdmin
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: not projectAdmin
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_conditions: authorized
    q_check_conditions --> q_check_tokens: refundEndTime < now AND tokensSupplied == true
    q_check_conditions --> q_revert_cond: conditions not met
    q_revert_cond --> [*]: revert ConditionsNotMet
    q_check_tokens --> q_check_withdrawn: capitalWithdrawn == false
    q_check_tokens --> q_revert_withdrawn: already withdrawn
    q_revert_withdrawn --> [*]: revert AlreadyWithdrawn
    q_check_withdrawn --> q_calc_fees: capitalWithdrawn = true
    q_calc_fees --> q_transfer_legion: legionFee = raisedCapital * legionFeeBps / 10000
    q_transfer_legion --> q_transfer_referrer: transfer legionFee to legionFeeRecipient
    q_transfer_referrer --> q_transfer_project: transfer referrerFee to referrerAddress
    q_transfer_project --> [*]: transfer remaining to projectAdmin, emit CapitalWithdrawn

    note right of q_calc_fees
        INV-001: capital can only be withdrawn once
        INV-002: tokens must be supplied before capital withdrawal
        INV-003: fees are distributed before project receives capital
        INV-004: raisedCapital = legionFee + referrerFee + projectCapital
    end note
